# Running AI Coach Repo Wiki

This file is for AI handoff only.

If you need product overview, read [README.md](/home/ethan/work/projects/running-ai-coach/README.md).
If you need real architecture detail, read [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](/home/ethan/work/projects/running-ai-coach/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).
If you need coding rules, read [AGENTS.md](/home/ethan/work/projects/running-ai-coach/AGENTS.md).

## Repo in 30 seconds

- This repo is a Chinese-language running coach product.
- Main UX is COROS OAuth + chat.
- FIT upload still exists, but it is secondary.
- Deterministic code computes facts.
- The LLM only explains those facts.

Do not break this invariant:

`source -> parsed/shared model -> rule layer -> report -> LLM wording`

